	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a domino per Iesum Christum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Doctissime <persName ref="p495">Hainrice</persName>, <persName>Paulus Campidonensis</persName> tuam erga <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>se humanitatem<note type="margin">a.R. nachgetragen: <persName ref="p8426">Rasdorfer</persName></note> summopere michi commendavit nuper rediens, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>sciscitans, num quid interim accidisset, quod <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>egisset, compertaque rerediit ad suos 21.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Interea optato venit ad me <persName>Iohannes</persName> noster praesentium <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>lator indicans se<note type="misc">gestrichen</note> itineri sese accinxisse <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> versus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Nacta itaque oportunitate nolui te latere, in quibus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>erumnis versemur; minantur <persName>Cesareani</persName> obsidionem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et eversionem urbis nostre, nobis autem exquisitissim<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>a tormenta parata, nostrates vero hactenus <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>inconcussi perstant.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Inducie duodecim dierum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>a <persName>Cesare</persName> statute, quibus evolutis ni consentiamus <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ac suo Interim nos subdamus, actum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>de nobis esse inquiunt.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nos ardentissimis precibus <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>patrem nostrum in celis precamur, respicere in <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>minas eorum velit et audire omnia verba Senacherib <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>blasphemantem se, cuius auxilio freti ne <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>pili facimus tonitrua, fulmina, coruscationes <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>papisticas.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Maior est, qui in nobis est, quam qui <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>in mundo.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Spero, optime vir, nos haudquaquam <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>flectendos, sed duraturos in finem precibus ecclesie <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>tue fulti, cui causam nostram commendari maximopere <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>cupimus.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Preterea vobis consultum iri optamus, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ne <placeName ref="l875">Hispanicis</placeName> technis aereque proditorio adobruti simi<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>libus casibus involvamini.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">In Excubiis, vir bone, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>crede mihi, vobis standum.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Tenduntur vobis insidie; <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>admonitos vos velim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Paratur exercitus contra <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>vos idque clam; vigilandum profecto.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Perpendite, quid <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><placeName ref="l232">Ißprugii</placeName> in vos moliatur, quid princeps non <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>longe ab <placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName>, quid copie circumcirca.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ferunt <persName ref="p18538">Cesaris</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>filium ingentissimas copias secum allaturum.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">mentem <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>tenes; calamo non omnia commitenda enim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale, mi Hanrice, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>et saluta meo ac uxoris mee nomine uxorem tuam et <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Bibliandrum</persName> conterraneum et fratres in domino singulos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p1120">Iacobus Fer</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><placeName ref="l291">Lindavię</placeName> 14. iulii anno 48.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">P<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ietate ac multiiuga erudicione prestanti <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>domino <persName ref="p495">Hainrico Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ecclesie <placeName ref="l587">Tigurine</placeName> antistiti, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>amico suo charissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
